COLLISION
Note that the code reads in order:
(1) Eth   dE
(2) scale scale
(3) type of inelastic collision
Eth= threshold energy of reaction
dE= energy gained by heavy byproduct particles
scale= multiplicative factor for columns
Byproduct electrons share the remaining incident electron energy 
